<main class="frame" id="top">

  <!-- ================= HERO ================= -->
  <section class="sec hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="k"><b>◆</b> Open source · MIT · built for data engineers</span>
        <h1>Query everything.<br>Move <em>nothing.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Lode is an open-source columnar warehouse that ships as a single 38&nbsp;MB binary. Land <code>CDC</code> streams, parquet drops and dbt models in one place — then query them with plain SQL, at memory speed.</p>
