        </button>
        <div class="acc-panel"><div class="acc-body"><span></span><div>
          <p>No coordinator, no ZooKeeper, no JVM heap tuning at 2 a.m. The storage engine, the query planner and the ingestion workers ship in one static executable that runs the same on your laptop and on a c6i.4xlarge.</p>
          <code>$ lode serve --data ./lake --listen :5433</code>
        </div></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="acc-item">
        <button class="acc-head">
